    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's hard to see meaning when everything's just... wrong. i look at my friends and their families and then i look at myself and i just feel like a glitch. like the universe made a mistake and i'm the only one left to pay for it. i feel like i'm just draining the air out of the room for nothing.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
